DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The vviiooccoonn driver provides support for the virtio(4) console interface
     provided by KVM, QEMU, and others.

     It provides serial ports that are attached as ttys.  Use as a kernel con‐
     sole for OpenBSD is not yet supported.  The multiport feature is not yet
     supported.

